        "text": "<subagent_notification>\n{\"agent_path\":\"01a027ba-e45e-7f72-a60a-67cc71708182\",\"status\":{\"completed\":\"Kesimpulan: endpoint baru terpisah diperlukan. Endpoint form saat ini hanya dapat mengeksekusi node Form yang sudah tersimpan di `page_builder.vars`; Canvas memakai `item.settings` dan `formValues` lokal, lalu menghentikan submit tanpa melakukan request. Jangan menambahkan `auth` ke route publik yang ada karena itu akan merusak form pada halaman published.\\n\\nAlur aktual:\\n\\n`Canvas state` → *(saat ini berhenti di `@submit.prevent`)*  \\n`published/draft renderer` → route form publik → controller memuat page tersimpan → handler membaca node tersimpan → validasi/Collect/Email/Email2/Webhook → runtime melakukan redirect.\\n\\nAnchor penting:\\n\\n- Route v2.3 existing hanya `throttle:20,1`, tanpa `auth`: [experimentalFeaturesWebv2.php](/D:/Laragon/www/laravel-13-phoenix/routes/experimentalFeaturesWebv2.php:38) dan [baris 48](/D:/Laragon/www/laravel-13-phoenix/routes/experimentalFeaturesWebv2.php:48).\\n- Editor mengirim `pageData`, `saveUrl`, dan `csrfToken`, tetapi belum ada URL test Form: [editor_shell.blade.php](/D:/Laragon/www/laravel-13-phoenix/resources/views/pagebuilder_elementor_v23/editor_shell.blade.php:55).\\n- Canvas memakai state lokal `formValues`, merender kontrol aktif, tetapi form hanya `@submit.prevent`: [Canvas.vue](/D:/Laragon/www/laravel-13-phoenix/public/js/pagebuilder_elementor_v23/widgets/pro/shared/Canvas.vue:13), [kontrol dan tombol submit](/D:/Laragon/www/laravel-13-phoenix/public/js/pagebuilder_elementor_v23/widgets/pro/shared/Canvas.vue:70), [state Form](/D:/Laragon/www/laravel-13-phoenix/public/js/pagebuilder_elementor_v23/widgets/pro/shared/Canvas.vue:1456).\\n- Controller existing memuat page berdasarkan URI/ID lalu memanggil handler: [PageBuilderElementorV23Controller.php](/D:/Laragon/www/laravel-13-phoenix/app/Http/Controllers/Web/PageBuilderElementorV23/PageBuilderElementorV23Controller.php:272). `resolve